⚡️🇸🇾🇹🇷 Syria's Foreign Minister, in a meeting with Turkey's Foreign Minister, stated: "We continue our diplomatic efforts to stop the repeated Israeli attacks in southern Syria and work steadily to consolidate stability, reaffirming our condemnation and denunciation of any attack on our land and sovereignty."

He added: "The region is clearly moving to establish a single foundation for stability, which is the elimination of any armed formations outside the legal framework. Here, we agreed to support the efforts and steps led by our brothers in Iraq and Lebanon to enhance regional stability."

